                    </div>
                    <div class="yg-quote-placeholder yg-mb9-quote-placeholder" id="ygQuotePlaceholder">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><strong>جاهزون للمراجعة</strong><span>نفحص السعر والتوفر قبل التثبيت النهائي.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="yg-quote-content yg-v8-quote-content yg-mb9-quote-content" id="ygQuoteContent" hidden>
                        <div class="yg-v8-review-hero yg-mb9-review-hero"><span><i class="bi bi-person-check"></i></span><div><small>العميل</small><strong id="ygQuoteCustomer">--</strong></div></div>
                        <div class="yg-v8-money-grid yg-mb9-money-grid">
                            <div><span>سعر الحجز</span><strong id="ygQuoteBase">0</strong></div>
                            <div><span>الخدمات</span><strong id="ygQuoteServices">0</strong></div>
                            <div><span>رسوم التنظيف</span><strong id="ygQuoteCleaning">0</strong></div>
                            <div><span>الضريبة <small id="ygQuoteTaxPercent">0%</small></span><strong id="ygQuoteTax">0</strong></div>
                            <div class="is-discount" id="ygQuoteDiscountRow" hidden><span>الخصم</span><strong id="ygQuoteDiscount">-0</strong></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="yg-quote-total yg-v8-quote-total yg-mb9-quote-total"><span>الإجمالي النهائي</span><strong id="ygQuoteTotal">0</strong></div>
                        <div class="yg-quote-split yg-v8-quote-split yg-mb9-quote-split"><div><small>العربون المطلوب</small><strong id="ygQuoteDeposit">0</strong></div><div><small>المتبقي</small><strong id="ygQuoteRemaining">0</strong></div></div>
                        <div class="yg-quote-state" id="ygQuoteState">--</div>
                        <div class="yg-quote-units" id="ygQuoteUnits" hidden></div>
                        <div class="yg-quote-promo" id="ygQuotePromo" hidden></div>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="yg-preview-btn yg-v8-preview-btn yg-mb9-preview-btn" id="ygPreviewManualBooking"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i><span>إعادة فحص السعر والتوفر</span></button>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <footer class="yg-studio-footer yg-v8-footer yg-mb9-footer">
            <div class="yg-mb9-footer-note"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i><span><strong>الحجز محمي من التعارض</strong><small>يعاد فحص التوفر لحظة التثبيت.</small></span></div>
            <div class="yg-studio-footer-actions yg-v8-footer-actions yg-mb9-footer-actions">
                <button type="button" class="yg-secondary-btn yg-v8-cancel-btn yg-mb9-cancel-btn" data-yg-close="manual"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i><span>إلغاء</span></button>
                <button type="button" class="yg-step-nav-btn yg-step-nav-btn--back yg-v8-back-btn yg-mb9-back-btn" id="ygManualStepBack" disabled aria-disabled="true"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i><span>السابق</span></button>
                <div class="yg-mb9-primary-slot">
                    <button type="button" class="yg-step-nav-btn yg-step-nav-btn--next yg-v8-next-btn yg-mb9-next-btn" id="ygManualStepNext"><span>التالي</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i></button>
                    <button type="button" class="yg-create-booking-btn yg-v8-create-btn yg-mb9-create-btn" id="ygCreateManualBooking" hidden><span>تأكيد الحجز</span><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
